              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Reeba, noija kufa, oshangye baashwenkuru; bwanyima aba bantu baryaimuka, baraaye nibakurata baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga ab'omu nsi, ei barikuza kutuuramu, banyimuure, baite endagaano yangye ei naaragaine nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.16",
